<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Through days of toil when heart doth fail,</l><l>God will take care of you!</l><l>When dangers fierce your path assail,</l><l>God will take care of you!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>All you may need He will provide,</l><l>God will take care of you!</l><l>Trust Him, and you will be satisfied,</l><l>God will take care of you!</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Lonely and sad, from friends apart,</l><l>God will take care of you!</l><l>He will give peace to your aching heart,</l><l>God will take care of you!</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>No matter what may be the test,</l><l>God will take care of you!</l><l>Lean, weary one, upon His breast,</l><l>God will take care of you!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
